{
  "name": "tools.wisefowl.org",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Browser-based tools for tools.wisefowl.org. Most tools are static files; apps/ (e.g. music-viz) are built with Vite. `npm run build` assembles the deployable site into dist/.",
